        # In the current loop:
        # When node=a, neighbors include b, c. If b-c edge exists, we increment count.
        # When node=b, neighbors include a, c. If a-c edge exists, we increment count.
        # When node=c, neighbors include a, b. If a-b edge exists, we increment count.
        # So each triangle is counted 3 times.

